</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
    <div class="content">
        <h1 class="section-title">Abby's House</h1>
        <p>Center for Women and Families</p>
        <p>IFC Presentation</p>
        <p>February {{ current_year }}</p>

        <h2 class="subsection-title">Our Mission</h2>
        <p>Our mission is to provide the WOU community with educational programming, information, and referral services designed to promote equity and non-violence. We embrace a feminist model that empowers all people to actively stand against all forms of violence, harassment, verbal abuse, discrimination, and hatred.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar"></div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div class="content">
        <h2 class="subsection-title">Our Services</h2>
        <ul>
            <li class="list-item">Resources and Referrals</li>
            <li class="list-item">Confidential advocacy</li>
            <li class="list-item">Library</li>
            <li class="list-item">Educational Programs</li>
            <li class="list-item">Outreach Presentations</li>
            <li class="list-item">Site for: Internships, Practicum, course projects, community service hours</li>
            <li class="list-item">Jeanne Deane Abby's House Scholarship</li>
            <li class="list-item">Abby's House app</li>
            <li class="list-item">available at iTunes</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="subsection-title">Abby's House Advocates</h2>
        <!-- Placeholder for image grid -->
        <div style="height: 150px; background-color: #eee; margin-bottom: 20px;">[Image Grid Placeholder]</div>

        <ul>
            <li class="list-item">14 Trained Advocates work between 4-5 Hours per week</li>
            <li class="list-item">3-Day training</li>
            <li class="list-item">Gender and Sexuality, Diversity, Resources and Referrals, Dealing with Individuals in Crisis, Mental Health, Sexual Violence</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar"></div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div class="content">
        <h2 class="subsection-title">Advocacy</h2>
        <ul>
            <li class="list-item">Abby's House Director and Assistant Director are confidential advocates</li>
            <li class="list-item">Student Advocates are considered responsible employees and are required to report:
                <ul>
                    <li class="list-item">dating and domestic violence</li>
                    <li class="list-item">sexual assault</li>
                    <li class="list-item">and stalking</li>
                </ul>
            </li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="subsection-title">Resources and Referrals</h2>
        <ul>
            <li class="list-item">By the Numbers 2014-15: see handout</li>
            <li class="list-item">Fall 2015</li>
            <li class="list-item">24 referrals</li>
            <li class="list-item">21 students, 3 faculty/staff</li>
            <li class="list-item">Top issues:
                <ul>
                    <li class="list-item">Mental Health Issues</li>
                    <li class="list-item">Sexual Assault/Rape</li>
                    <li class="list-item">Housing assistance/homelessness</li>
                    <li class="list-item">Dating or domestic violence</li>
                </ul>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar"></div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div class="content">
        <h2 class="subsection-title">Referral Topics: Fall 2015</h2>
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
            <div>
                <ul>
                    <li class="list-item">Housing assistance/homelessness</li>
                    <li class="list-item">Dating/domestic violence</li>
                    <li class="list-item">Sexual Assault</li>
                    <li class="list-item">Stress and Anxiety</li>
                    <li class="list-item">Sexual Harassment</li>
                    <li class="list-item">Pregnancy/Title IX</li>
                    <li class="list-item">Rape</li>
                    <li class="list-item">Stalking</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div>
                <ul>
                    <li class="list-item">Suicide</li>
                    <li class="list-item">LGBTQ support</li>
                    <li class="list-item">Academic Support</li>
                    <li class="list-item">Professional development</li>
                    <li class="list-item">Child care</li>
                    <li class="list-item">Child abuse</li>
                    <li class="list-item">Food insecurity</li>
                    <li class="list-item">Transportation</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <h2 class="subsection-title">Education and Outreach</h2>
        <p>Fall 2015</p>
        <ul>
            <li class="list-item">8 Educational Programs</li>
            <li class="list-item">719 people participated in educational programs/events</li>
            <li class="list-item">4 Outreach presentations</li>
            <li class="list-item">93 students reached</li>
        </ul>
        <!-- Placeholder for image -->
        <div style="height: 150px; background-color: #eee; margin-top: 20px;">[Image Placeholder]</div>
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar"></div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div class="content">
        <h2 class="subsection-title">Educational Programs</h2>
        <!-- Placeholder for image -->
        <div style="height: 200px; background-color: #eee; margin-bottom: 20px;">[Image Placeholder]</div>

        <ul>
            <li class="list-item">Love Your Body Day Table</li>
            <li class="list-item">OSU Women, Gender and Sexuality Studies Graduate Program Reception</li>
            <li class="list-item">#Selfies for Survivors</li>
            <li class="list-item">Take Back the Night</li>
