</div>

<div class="page">
    <div class="content">
        <h2 class="subsection-title">We Provide...</h2>
        <ul>
            <li class="list-item">Campus, Local, State, and National Resources</li>
            <li class="list-item">Resource Materials</li>
            <li class="list-item">Publications, books, app</li>
            <li class="list-item">Educational Programs</li>
            <li class="list-item">Leadership Opportunities</li>
            <li class="list-item">Practicum/Internships</li>
            <li class="list-item">Training</li>
            <li class="list-item">Peer Support by Trained Advocates</li>
            <li class="list-item">Safe Space for Survivors</li>
            <li class="list-item">Annual Scholarship</li>
            <li class="list-item">Sense of Community</li>
        </ul>
        <!-- Placeholder for image -->
        <div style="height: 150px; background-color: #eee; margin-top: 20px;">[Image Placeholder]</div>

        <h2 class="subsection-title">Our Impact...</h2>
        <p>Fall 2015</p>
        <ul>
            <li class="list-item">In our community we reached <span data-field="impact.reached_people_fall_2015">{{ impact.reached_people_fall_2015 }}</span> people!</li>
            <li class="list-item">Last Year (2014-2015)</li>
            <li class="list-item">In our community we reached <span data-field="impact.reached_people_last_year">{{ impact.reached_people_last_year }}</span> people!</li>
        </ul>
        <!-- Placeholder for image -->
        <div style="height: 200px; background-color: #eee; margin-top: 20px;">[Image Placeholder]</div>
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar"></div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div class="content">
        <h2 class="subsection-title">Abby's House Budget Overview</h2>
        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>Category</th>
                    <th>FY 17 Budget</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td>Student Employment (wages and OPE)</td>
                    <td><span data-field="budget.student_employment_budget">{{ budget.student_employment_budget }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Services and Supplies</td>
                    <td><span data-field="budget.services_supplies_budget">{{ budget.services_supplies_budget }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Total</td>
                    <td><span data-field="budget.total_budget">{{ budget.total_budget }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Revenue (projected)</td>
                    <td><span data-field="budget.revenue_projected">{{ budget.revenue_projected }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Total request</td>
                    <td><span data-field="budget.total_request">{{ budget.total_request }}</span></td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <h2 class="subsection-title">Budget Request (FY17)</h2>
        <ul>
            <li class="list-item">Request of <span data-field="budget_request.total_request_value">{{ budget_request.total_request_value }}</span> reflects minimum operating costs to keep center functioning</li>
            <li class="list-item">Supplies, postage, duplicating, telecom, and memberships include fixed costs</li>
            <li class="list-item">Director and Assistant Director positions are funded through the WOU Campus Against Sexual Assault Grant program.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar"></div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div class="content">
        <h2 class="subsection-title">Budget Reductions (FY17)</h2>
        <ul>
            <li class="list-item">Reductions = cut student employment hours</li>
        </ul>
        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>Category</th>
                    <th>Base budget</th>
                    <th>-5%</th>
                    <th>-10%</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td>Student Employment</td>
                    <td><span data-field="reduction_table.base_budget">{{ reduction_table.base_budget }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="reduction_table.minus_5_percent">{{ reduction_table.minus_5_percent }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="reduction_table.minus_10_percent">{{ reduction_table.minus_10_percent }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Total request</td>
                    <td><span data-field="reduction_table.total_base">{{ reduction_table.total_base }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="reduction_table.total_minus_5">{{ reduction_table.total_minus_5 }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="reduction_table.total_minus_10">{{ reduction_table.total_minus_10 }}</span></td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
        <p>Direct negative impact on the incomes of student advocates</p>

        <h2 class="subsection-title">Budget: Benefits for Students</h2>
        <p>National Women's Studies Association</p>
        <ul>
            <li class="list-item">Professional development for the center and our staff</li>
        </ul>
        <p>AAUW University Partnership</p>
        <ul>
            <li class="list-item">All WOU students can sign up for a FREE Student Affiliate Membership to AAUW</li>
            <li class="list-item">Membership provides access to scholarships, grants, leadership conferences, workshops, trainings</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar"></div>
</div>


